						(xy 0 0) (xy 0 1.27) (xy -1.016 1.905) (xy 0 2.54) (xy 1.016 1.905) (xy 0 1.27)
					)
					(stroke
						(width 0)
						(type default)
					)
					(fill
						(type none)
					)
				)
			)
			(embedded_fonts no)
		)
	)
	(text "Nominal midband input impedance ~570k. AC gain ~101 x 100/570 = 17.7.\nNominal trigger ~4mVrms at 1kHz; tuning/bench value, not a guaranteed noise threshold.\nAt 2Vrms the detector saturates intentionally; it is outside the through audio path.\n470k limits loading when unpowered. Design input: up to 2Vrms sine (2.83V peak)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 248.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1aa54b70-e8ea-4d8d-8e60-9d501e319cbf")
	)
	(text "30R preload: ~167mA / 0.83W at 5V. Use 3W flameproof; keep clear of capacitors.\n100R + 47u filters switching ripple. Bias ~1.1V; LM358 retained.\nSPU03 INPUT IS 5V ONLY. Check isolated raw rails 4-6V and quiet rails >=3.6V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "287856f2-509b-4494-89a9-594e838e7d05")
	)
	(text "CONTROL SIDE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 342.9 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4554c49c-8d8d-4905-b1a7-e716ddfecc0e")
	)
	(text "Branch clamps only;\nnever in the main audio path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 261.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "52152703-eb91-4548-af96-b09ef96a9ede")
	)
	(text "Optocoupler collector is the only\nlogic interface. Both channels\nwire-OR into one active-low input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5cc9d137-c2c8-4f4a-b8c0-cfedd54c43cc")
	)
	(text "R CHANNEL - INDEPENDENT GALVANIC ISOLATION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a15567f7-efbc-4388-8142-233cafbe4ba8")
	)
	(text "Isolated return is tied ONLY to SEL_R_RETURN, after its source-selection relay.\nNo detector wire, resistor, capacitor or shield connects this return to control GND or the other channel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b9e9815a-f6e0-41de-8db7-fcd72e14d95f")
	)
